# the `netron` pip package (MIT License, Copyright (c) Lutz Roeder,
# https://github.com/lutzroeder/netron) and served at runtime from
# site-packages. This patch removes Google Analytics telemetry, the
# ipinfo.io region lookup and the cookie-consent dialog so the tool stays
# strictly local-first: nothing is ever sent to an external service.
#
# Applies to: netron>=9.3.5,<10  (generated against netron 9.3.5)
# Applied by: modeltoolbox.netron_assets (fail-loud if the source drifts)

